"ros/urdf_tutorial/blob/ros2/urdf/08-macroed.urdf.xacro>`_, in addition to "
"the default inertial macro shown above."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Using-Xacro-to-Clean-Up-a-URDF-File/Using-Xacro-to-Clean-Up-a-URDF-File.rst:238
msgid ""
